<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Sasol to commission mining chemicals plant.</title>
<headline>Sasol to commission mining chemicals plant.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fuel-from-coal producer Sasol Ltd said on Thursday it would commission its first dedicated plant for the production of mining chemicals at Sasolburg this month.</p>
<p>The 13 million rand plant will produce an annual 10,000 to 11,000 tonnes of mining chemicals, for use primarily in the recovery of copper ores and platinum group metals.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
